############################### commit 7b935d9 ###############################
commit 7b935d97e5ff3d33032c4887640fffc6020c8dad
Author: Chenghui Weng <144981080+weng-chenghui@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Apr 17 17:20:59 2026 +0800

    Close six gaps in PGG formalisation (Fixes 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7)
    
    Fix 1: Bridge pgl_bound to PGL(2,F_5) ≅ S_5.
      pgl_bound.v: add pgl_card, pgl_card_eq, pgl_card_5, card_set_S5,
      pgl2_5_eq_s5. cover_tradeoff.v: add pgl_bound_eq_pgl_card and
      import pgl_bound (closing ring_scope and group_scope after import).
    
    Fix 6: Clarify cd_ramif semantics.
      Rename cd_ramif → cd_total_ramif in CoveringData. Add obligation
      field cd_ramif_ge_n_branch : cd_n_branch <= cd_total_ramif and
      definition cd_fully_ramified. Discharge the new obligation at all
      five write sites (cover_genus0/1/2 and s5x5 instance); add one new
      section Hypothesis higher_genus_ramif_ge_nbr in cover_genus1's
      higher_genus section.
    
    Fix 3: Uniform name for the genus-0 automorphism obligation.
      cover_tradeoff.v: add genus0_automorphism_bound Definition with
      Arguments clear-implicits. Add named Lemma <inst>_genus0_automorphism
      at each of the four instances; update MkThresholdWitness call sites
      to use the named lemma instead of (fun _ => <inst>_genus0_pgl).
    
    Fix 5: Named ts_recon_correct re-exports at each instance.
      Add Lemma <inst>_ts_recon_correct parameterised by a supplied
      PGGInterface, proved by exact: ar_protocol_correct. Covers s5,
      s5x5, den Boer, Kim.
    
    Fix 7: UC-security composition Conjecture.
      New file pgg-smc/protocol/pgg_uc_security.v with placeholder
      Adversary/Simulator types, F_shuffle, ideal_exec, uc_distance,
      and Conjecture uc_simulation. Registered in _CoqProject.
    
    Fix 2: Rayleigh Parameter → Axiom.
      s5_mixing.v: promote Parameter s5_rayleigh_Qsq_R to Axiom with
      companion Definitions s5_sos_lower_triangular, s5_sos_diagonal
      and proved Lemma s5_sos_diagonal_nonneg. Fix 4 (n_traces bridge)
      was already discharged at pgg_raag.v:2256 and is not part of
      this commit.
    
    Full subproject builds clean.

